<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 4.32 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 4.32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 4.32 percent on Sunday from 4.86 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>($1=0.708 dinar)</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
